{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04267","headline":"宿温城望军营 · 骆宾王","name":"宿温城望军营","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"虏地寒胶折，边城夜柝闻。\n兵符关帝阙，天策动将军。\n塞静胡笳彻，沙明楚练分。\n风旗翻翼影，霜剑转龙文。\n白羽摇如月，青山断若云。\n烟疎疑卷幔，尘灭似销氛。\n投笔怀班业，临戎想顾勳。\n还应雪汉耻，持此报明君。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"骆宾王","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04267.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04267","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}